      "findings": [
        "r1s8 (new code, old one-row split) == main within noise: the gain is the row sharing, not the rewrite",
        "unroll x2/x4 and software pipelining regress (registers, no latency to hide)",
        "ALU-only diagnostic (no weight/scale/bias traffic) runs at the full kernel's speed and the loads-only diagnostic 2x faster: the kernel is instruction-issue bound at ~5 instructions per element, the 2 fma + extract + convert per element being fixed by bit identity",
